WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.560
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.279
No taunting your future hosts!

00:00:06.279 --> 00:00:11.150
Dr. Bright is a force of chaos that annot
be bound to only one mortal form.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.150
We all know this.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:16.480
His consciousness is contained in that pretty
little amulet around his neck.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:21.490
Every so often, like a hermit crab changing
its shell, Dr. Bright moves on from his human

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:24.820
host to take up residence in a new flesh shell.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:25.820
Ugh.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:30.699
Anyway, Dr. Bright is not allowed to taunt
or harass his future hosts in any way, including

00:00:30.699 --> 00:00:35.300
telling them "You are about to become very
Bright," saying "Possession is nine-tenths

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.550
of the law," or referring to D-Class personnel
as "extra lives."

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:41.730
You'll never have a career in stand-up, Doctor.

